  "as_of": "2015-05-27",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would impose a supervisory levy on registered private health insurers to fund prudential regulation by the Australian Prudential Regulation Authority.",
   "The levy would remain quarterly during 2015-16, then become annual from 2016-17, calculated using ministerially determined amounts and the number of covered insurance policies.",
   "Its substantive provisions would begin with the companion prudential supervision legislation, as part of replacing the Private Health Insurance Administration Council's regulatory and funding arrangements."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Annual levy amounts would be capped at $2 for each single policy and $4 for each other policy.",
   "Insurers registered after the financial year's start would have their annual levy prorated for the remaining days.",
   "The Minister's levy determination would specify a census day for counting policies."
  ],
  "affected": "Registered private health insurers and the Minister responsible for setting levy amounts would be affected.",
